# Ollama serves qwen2.5:7b with a 4,096-token context by default, which truncates the answer prompt
# (10 retrieved chunks, up to about 10.5k tokens). Its OpenAI-compatible endpoint cannot change num_ctx per
# request, so the local profile uses this variant. num_predict stops a structured-output reply that never ends,
# and temperature 0 makes answers repeatable (sampled answers flip between runs of the same question).
#   ollama create qwen2.5-7b-16k -f config/ollama/qwen2.5-7b-16k.Modelfile
FROM qwen2.5:7b
PARAMETER num_ctx 16384
PARAMETER num_predict 2048
PARAMETER temperature 0
